From 015657caacb946bdc0104522fe3a929cba5ed4a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Smith <josh.smith@plooto.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:21:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: contain all vault paths inside VAULT_PATH

Every VaultManager operation resolved its path with path.join(vaultPath, input)
and no containment check, so a client holding the API key could read and write
outside the vault. All 33 call sites now go through _resolve(), which rejects
.. traversal, absolute paths outside the vault and NUL bytes, and treats a
leading slash as vault-relative for client compatibility.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
